}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d0e7e5c-c0ce-4955-95d6-e6c95fbf5a58","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"日本の経営者、毎年4%も給料を上げる感覚、もうないから。","ts":"1634699891.484200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"money_with_wings","count":2,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IM/oZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0765ae1-df1d-4aa9-b0c5-1c66f6db41c4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"為替はまたいろんな要素で変わりますからね。インフレ率+4.1%っていうだけでも、日本円の収入はキツイなって想像できます。","ts":"1634699860.483700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ELLS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bb23829-35e8-46db-a9c8-ffbe541fa26e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(なお僕の収入は日本円です)","ts":"1634699733.482700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npZ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e74035ca-cae3-4f5e-a849-44977151e96f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"収入が日本円の人は、毎年どんどん外国旅行の難易度が高まっていく","ts":"1634699724.482400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rH=w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a7b74e1-e676-4495-b15b-92a2a8798ea2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"2020年から2021年で","ts":"1634699699.481700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZkS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef3753cf-1588-471e-95c1-7bf8209a3ba1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"日本はインフレ率+0%\nカナダはインフレ率+4.1%\n為替が+10%程度","ts":"1634699695.481400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r+/E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"507836ca-2d7f-405d-8e04-11efeda45417","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"日本円基準でみるとカナダのインフレ率は+13%です","ts":"1634699652.480600","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1634699678.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]},{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ye4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99302a77-cd82-4dd7-9c2e-d5c776267906","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"こないだインフレ率計算したんですが、","ts":"1634699643.480300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Ox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e03a7a69-410c-4e1a-8f76-e72747dd7ea6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"世界株、長期で見れば上がるのは確実なんだけども、普通に考えれば物価はそれ以上の速度で上がる気もする。物価が30年あがってない(むしろ下がってる分野もある)日本が異常だし、いろいろと足元が軋んでる感覚。","ts":"1634699374.480000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M+0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2bbfe67-950f-4c22-b1a1-dc5dc285c3e0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最近買った長期保有前提の株インデックスは、値動き激しいものの半年で10%近いパフォーマンスを出しており…これ良いのか? っていう気になってる。","ts":"1634699179.478000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qcgj2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62361c40-13cb-49ce-9cc8-95dec62fd50e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おお、でかい! \u0026gt; +5%","ts":"1634698665.476600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lY6pL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5e769d1-57c4-4746-84ac-838a070f0079","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さて。このお金、次はどこにもっていこうか","ts":"1634698598.476200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G3ryC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3174a2a1-dff6-4418-b448-f3f6105f2aee","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"2年2か月で+10%でした。年率でいうと5%ちょっと欠けるくらい。為替差による増加も入ってるので純粋な利率ではないのだけれど。","ts":"1634697639.475500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634699106.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CQBZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea46c517-042e-463c-8d21-0f0fa85a460f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"保険の解約した!\n\n外貨建てが目標金額に達して、予定通り自動で円建てに移行して0.02%というアホみたいな金利になったので。","ts":"1634697551.474600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otz","count":5,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UFHQ7TNT0","U023KQQKC6T","U01BY3SDBRS","UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6A+g"}]}]
